    'en': 'Scan a whole folder on this device to list documents — like a music library.\nPick the folder ONCE; next time the app opens the list appears automatically.',
    'zh': '扫描本机整个文件夹即可看到文档列表——就像音乐库。\n文件夹只需选一次，下次打开应用就会自动显示列表。',
